{"id":"v1","level":4,"levelName":"The verb system","n":1,"of":15,"title":"What will happen","titleHe":"זְמַן עָתִיד","goal":"Use the future of pa'al, where the person is a prefix rather than an ending.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"The past hangs its person on the end of the word. The future puts it on the front — א for I, ת for you and she, י for he, נ for we. Once you know those four letters you can read any future verb's person off its first letter."},{"type":"binyan","he":"פָּעַל","en":"pa'al (kal)","note":"The plain, basic verb — the one most everyday actions use.","verb":{"root":"כ־ת־ב","inf":"לִכְתֹּב","en":"to write"},"tense":"future","rows":[{"label":"I","he":"אֲנִי","form":"אֶכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (m.)","he":"אַתָּה","form":"תִּכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (f.)","he":"אַתְּ","form":"תִּכְתְּבִי"},{"label":"he","he":"הוּא","form":"יִכְתֹּב"},{"label":"she","he":"הִיא","form":"תִּכְתֹּב"},{"label":"we","he":"אֲנַחְנוּ","form":"נִכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (m.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּם","form":"תִּכְתְּבוּ"},{"label":"you (f.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּן","form":"תִּכְתְּבוּ"},{"label":"they","he":"הֵם / הֵן","form":"יִכְתְּבוּ"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"ת does double duty: תִּכְתֹּב is both you (m.) will write and she will write. Only context or a pronoun tells them apart."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"מָחָר אֶכְתֹּב מִכְתָּב.","en":"Tomorrow I'll write a letter."},{"he":"מָתַי תָּבוֹא?","en":"When will you come?"},{"he":"נִרְאֶה.","en":"We'll see."}]}],"vocab":[{"he":"מִכְתָּב","en":"letter","translit":"michtav"},{"he":"אוּלַי","en":"maybe","translit":"ulai"},{"he":"בְּוַדַּאי","en":"certainly","translit":"bevadai"},{"he":"אַחַר כָּךְ","en":"afterwards","translit":"achar kach"},{"he":"עוֹד","en":"more, still, another","translit":"od"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["cupboard, wardrobe","letter","of","claim, argument"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מִכְתָּב","translit":"michtav"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["hard, difficult","un-, without","maybe","waits"],"correct":2,"prompt":"אוּלַי","translit":"ulai"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["aeroplane","ear","dawn","certainly"],"correct":3,"prompt":"בְּוַדַּאי","translit":"bevadai"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["afterwards","eleven (f.)","root","dawn"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אַחַר כָּךְ","translit":"achar kach"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["what happened, what's wrong","more, still, another","lives, resides","crown"],"correct":1,"prompt":"עוֹד","translit":"od"},{"type":"choice","q":"write — you (f.), future","options":["יִכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי","תִּכְתֹּב","אֶכְתֹּב"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: you (f.) is תִּכְתְּבִי."},{"type":"choice","q":"write — you (m.pl.), future","options":["תִּכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבוּ","אֶכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: you (m.pl.) is תִּכְתְּבוּ."},{"type":"match","pairs":[["מִכְתָּב","letter"],["אוּלַי","maybe"],["בְּוַדַּאי","certainly"],["אַחַר כָּךְ","afterwards"],["עוֹד","more, still, another"]]},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “afterwards”?","options":["אַחַר כָּךְ","מָסֹרֶת","שֶׁקֶר","מַסְתִּיר"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “maybe”?","options":["בֹּקֶר טוֹב","אוּלַי","שָׁלוֹשׁ","סֵפֶר"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"write — they, future","options":["תִּכְתְּבִי","אֶכְתֹּב","יִכְתְּבוּ","תִּכְתֹּב"],"correct":2,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: they is יִכְתְּבוּ."},{"type":"cloze","sentence":"מָחָר ___ מִכְתָּב.","en":"Tomorrow I'll write a letter.","options":["אֶכְתֹּב","בְּוַדַּאי","אוּלַי","מִכְתָּב"],"correct":0,"full":"מָחָר אֶכְתֹּב מִכְתָּב."},{"type":"read","he":"עוֹד","translit":"od","en":"more, still, another"},{"type":"choice","q":"write — you (m.), future","options":["יִכְתֹּב","אֶכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי","תִּכְתֹּב"],"correct":3,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: you (m.) is תִּכְתֹּב."},{"type":"choice","q":"write — she, future","options":["אֶכְתֹּב","תִּכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי","יִכְתֹּב"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: she is תִּכְתֹּב."},{"type":"type","q":"Write “certainly” in Hebrew","answer":"בְּוַדַּאי","hint":"bevadai"}]}